TI  - Tracheal Extramedullary Plasmacytoma Causing Near-Complete Airway Obstruction in 
      an HIV-Positive Man: A Case Report and Brief Literature Review.
PG  - e72771
LID - 10.1002/ccr3.72771 [doi]
LID - e72771
AB  - A 53-year-old HIV-positive man presented with progressive dyspnea, hoarseness, 
      and near-complete tracheal obstruction. Computed tomography and rigid 
      bronchoscopy identified a > 90% obstructing tracheal mass. Histopathology with 
      immunohistochemistry confirmed extramedullary plasmacytoma. Bronchoscopic 
      debulking relieved symptoms, and radiotherapy was planned.
