AB  - Sampling aortopulmonary window lymph nodes is technically challenging and often 
      requires surgical approaches. We report a minimally invasive robotic-assisted 
      transbronchial biopsy of AP window lymph nodes using cone-beam CT guidance, 
      enabling diagnosis of small cell lung cancer without surgical mediastinal biopsy.
