LID - e70253
AB  - Although rarely reported, endobronchial ultrasound (EBUS) can reveal unexpected 
      vascular findings such as pulmonary thromboembolism. Systematic evaluation of 
      pulmonary arteries during EBUS may identify central emboli, enabling timely 
      diagnosis and treatment.
