TI  - Precision in Midst of Crisis: Rigid Bronchoscopy in Management of Intrapulmonary 
      Hemorrhage.
PG  - 590-593
LID - 10.1007/s12070-024-05214-5 [doi]
AB  - Rarely we encountered massive intra-pulmonary hemorrhage in clinical practice, 
      which is always considered a life-threatening condition. In this case report we 
      will discuss its management with removing blood clots using a rigid bronchoscope. 
      Moreover, we also discuss about innovation, using a flexible fibre-optic 
      bronchoscope through the rigid bronchoscope and removing a huge blood clot from 
      terminal bronchioles.
