TI  - Occult Endobronchial Foreign Body Presenting as Persistent Lobar Collapse and 
      Severe Pneumonia.
PG  - e70466
LID - 10.1002/rcr2.70466 [doi]
LID - e70466
AB  - Foreign body aspiration is uncommon in adults and may present without a clear 
      aspiration history. We describe an adult patient with persistent lobar collapse 
      and severe pneumonia in whom bronchoscopy revealed an occult endobronchial 
      foreign body causing airway obstruction.
