TI  - Management of bronchopleural fistula using Amplatzer VSD occluder device.
PG  - 82-84
LID - 10.4103/lungindia.lungindia_174_25 [doi]
AB  - Bronchoscopic device closure plays an important role in the nonsurgical 
      management of bronchopleural fistulae. Herein, we describe the first Indian 
      report of the use of Amplatzer VSD occluder device for the management of a large 
      bronchopleural fistula using an innovative technique in which a snare was passed 
      through the working channel of a flexible bronchoscope to grasp the Amplatzer VSD 
      occluder device which was anchored parallel to the bronchoscope and then 
      maneuvered into the fistula.
